# Generated by scripts/watchdog/health-publish.sh — regenerated 2-3 times a day.
# The hand-edited roster (team-roster*.md) is tracked; these boards are not.
knowledge/operations/health-board.md
knowledge/operations/health-board_es-ES.md

# Generated by CONTA's build_static_site.py (mistral-gateway/accounting).
# The source of truth is the generator plus usage.db, not the rendered files:
# committing them means every regeneration produces a diff nobody reviewed.
# README.md is hand-written and stays tracked.
docs/accounting/*
!docs/accounting/README.md
